      "width": 260,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## inbox/\n**Zone 1a — Capture**\n\nDrop anything here.\nNo classification needed.\nClaude never edits files here."
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d4e5f678901234",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## archive/\n**Zone 1b — Source**\n\nProcessed source material.\nClaude moves files here.\nNever edited after ingestion.\n\n`clippings/` `papers/` `books/`\n`daily/` `ideas/` `docs/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "d4e5f67890123456",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## wiki/\n**Zone 2 — Knowledge**\n\nClaude-owned knowledge graph.\nConcepts, entities, syntheses.\nIndex and log maintained automatically."
    },
    {
      "id": "e5f6789012345678",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## dev/\n**Zone 3 — Work**\n\nYou drive, Claude assists.\nNo edits without approval.\n\n`adr/` `debriefs/` `projects/`\n`investigations/` `learning/`"
    }
  ],
